Body weights of the mice were weighed on the final day of the experiment. Immediately after euthanasia, spleens were collected and weighed. The spleen index was then calculated using the following formula:\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$Spleen\;index=\;spleen\;weight\left(mg\right)\div mouse\;body\;weight\left(g\right)$$\end{document}
